    "L4/L5 analog data are for Exp3174, azilsartan, losartan, and other ARB-like molecules; transferability is inferred from structural similarity.",
    "Fasted-state-specific PK data are absent."
  ],
  "decision_summary": "L4 provided affirmative absorption-liability evidence from Exp3174 (very low Caco-2 A-B permeability and high efflux) and azilsartan (low solubility/absorption), which combined with the query's dianionic state, low logD (0.56), and high TPSA supports F < 20%. L5 gut-wall efflux/intestinal-metabolism records are mostly for other molecules and do not provide query-specific evidence; they neither overturn nor strengthen the low prediction. Prediction remains low with moderate confidence."
